{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_019_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8fce0163345edcdf6f8b16f5b4d0fa30643a2e02fb16a7cc2e0e8b222c98e2ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1e9135c2860f9e5a1e16a89c45625d07b30c5368e7e217391f9aff0e87c28cc",
      "text": "今天承蒙您的陪伴，\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a7efe611661ce1b64fcf8ffa5505f2be734d420348d87533258902d52b0efe",
      "text": "制作人所感受到的这一切，今后哪怕\n一点一点也好，我都想将它们传播给更多人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5edafd810bfba0a152d2267f6d6a6200b7af5047a8ab2af03e21f6582ca8cf92",
      "text": "像这次一样轻松随性地享受也好，重视礼节规矩\n平静心境也罢，全都是茶道的魅力所在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48ffc31de676bfff464f2c679a81986390ee094c93931bca5ae377c46761585",
      "text": "为了能让大家更广泛地领略到茶道的乐趣，\n今后我也会作为偶像继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5a67f76e9e8a04dab9330e7342ab1b587e490ca53df89b16ccb09ebd9741f0e",
      "text": "……真是的，一不小心就说得太激动了呢。\n多少有些难为情起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc8a9ee6cb66c9957b0e37dc4ad67cf4430d7f109495c4e298540c72f3dac83f",
      "text": "不，我觉得这是一个非常棒的梦想。\n我也会全力支持您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f86a4bb3491f6cfee4b4d9fcddcc5d0abd43acc332aa32788c63b9cb6dc7391",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e3e72b9108e1d82dec5c543c83a0752b443baa6e168f448207949b42ec2be90",
      "text": "……聊着聊着有些口渴了。\n制作人，要不要再来一碗呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bff9a7b30290ff469afa6b5788c1d1ebf746299e737151ae96ea39806c382db",
      "text": "好的，请务必帮我再来一碗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b8956d66e77eec75323db23ec710a03ba289512f74812ca63ea98927fb7a18b",
      "text": "那么，我定当用心为您点茶。\n让我们再多享受片刻这段时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
